 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "You Are So Lovely"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "이리 사랑스러운 너"
   },
   {
    "en": "Lovely Wolf"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Feared by name alone, Shin Juhyeok never expected his toughest challenge to be... raising a kid? After rescuing a young hybrid named Lee Hae-on from an accident, Juhyeok planned to keep him around just until he recovered. But the once-scrawny stray grows up—fast—and now towers over his reluctant guardian, refusing to leave his side. Juhyeok can handle gangs and thugs, but nothing could prepare him for this: Hae-on’s first heat. Sweet, clingy, and completely unaware of personal space, Hae-on’s affection is anything but subtle. Raising a hybrid was never part of the plan—but neither was falling for one.\n\n[**Original Webtoon**](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/lovely_wolf)\n\n**Official Translations:** [English](https://www.lezhinus.com/en/comic/so_lovely), [Japanese](https://www.beltoon.jp/detail/lovely_wolf)\n\n*Note*:\n-The official English translation is uncensored.\n-The author has confirmed that English, Japanese, Spanish, Thai and T. Chinese translations are coming soon."
  },
